WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:01:39.130
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
01:39.400 --> 01:41.506
[Episode 15]

3
01:42.080 --> 01:44.313
[Maple Mansion]

4
02:21.360 --> 02:22.501
So?

5
02:23.080 --> 02:26.540
Maple Mansion's pretty nice in autumn, right?

6
02:28.200 --> 02:30.001
Yes, it is.

7
02:31.280 --> 02:35.119
Every maple tree here is carefully tended.

8
02:35.800 --> 02:38.073
There's nothing else like it in Nanhuai City.

9
02:40.720 --> 02:44.820
The brighter they burn, the bleaker it feels when they fall.

10
02:46.060 --> 02:52.060
The brighter they burn at their peak, the more desolate it feels when they fall.

11
02:55.280 --> 02:56.699
What's the big deal?

12
02:57.920 --> 03:02.040
If you like it, I'll bring you here every year.

13
03:07.640 --> 03:09.926
Have you forgotten?

14
03:10.840 --> 03:16.085
What's between us is just a trade where each of us gets what we need.

15
03:16.085 --> 03:18.380
Funny. There is no next year or the year after.

16
03:34.080 --> 03:36.259
Have you forgotten?

17
03:36.259 --> 03:40.060
How long you stay here is up to me.

18
03:53.640 --> 03:54.893
What?

19
03:55.506 --> 03:58.313
Don't you want Jiang Xue Ting released?

20
04:11.200 --> 04:12.960
That's more like it.

21
04:15.080 --> 04:17.480
Stop looking so miserable all the time.

22
04:28.640 --> 04:29.960
Don't worry.

23
04:30.880 --> 04:32.620
It will be a year at most.

24
04:33.519 --> 04:37.146
Once I'm bored with you, I'll let you go.

25
05:33.520 --> 05:35.420
How did it get bad so fast?

26
05:35.420 --> 05:38.680
I believe there are some nodules in Madam Ye's lungs.

27
05:38.680 --> 05:40.080
They must be surgically removed.

28
05:40.080 --> 05:41.820
Then why hasn't she had the surgery?

29
05:42.400 --> 05:43.733
I'm really sorry.

30
05:43.733 --> 05:45.519
We're not equipped to do that here.

31
05:45.519 --> 05:48.040
But I know a specialist in Jinping named Wei.

32
05:48.040 --> 05:49.819
He can perform this surgery.

33
05:49.819 --> 05:51.353
We've reached out to him,

34
05:51.353 --> 05:53.960
but it turns out he's off to Guangzhou tomorrow.

35
05:53.960 --> 05:56.513
He's not taking cases for now.

36
05:57.200 --> 05:58.573
Give me the address.

37
06:07.120 --> 06:11.959
Chang Xuan, it's late, and it's mountain roads all the way there. Let me go.

38
06:11.959 --> 06:14.100
And I'll go with Rui Tong.

39
06:14.100 --> 06:15.533
I'll go myself.

40
08:10.160 --> 08:14.880
[Jinping Jiyou Clinic]

41
08:15.956 --> 08:17.579
Excuse me, I'm looking for Dr. Wei.

42
08:17.579 --> 08:19.546
I'm sorry, we're closed.

43
08:22.640 --> 08:24.672
What's wrong with you? I told you we're closed.

44
08:24.672 --> 08:26.904
- What's going on? - He's trying to force his way in.

45
08:26.904 --> 08:28.699
I told him we're closed.

46
08:28.699 --> 08:29.840
Sorry, Dr. Wei.

47
08:29.840 --> 08:32.504
Someone in my family has a lung infection and is coughing up blood.

48
08:32.504 --> 08:33.960
She needs surgery right away.

49
08:33.960 --> 08:36.084
Sir, I'm very sorry.

50
08:36.084 --> 08:37.640
I'm taking a ship to Guangzhou tomorrow.

51
08:37.640 --> 08:38.879
I can't help you.

52
08:38.879 --> 08:41.079
Maybe you should find another doctor.

53
08:44.840 --> 08:46.493
Name your price.

54
08:46.493 --> 08:48.066
I'm taking you with me tonight.

55
08:48.066 --> 08:50.520
I'm sorry, but it's not about money.

56
08:50.520 --> 08:52.880
It's a scheduling conflict.

57
09:01.840 --> 09:03.693
Do you have time now?

58
09:16.760 --> 09:19.293
Miss Ye, there are some freshly made lotus pastries.

59
09:19.293 --> 09:20.974
Let me bring some for you.

60
09:21.553 --> 09:23.994
No, thanks. I don't have much of an appetite.

61
09:23.994 --> 09:28.633
Miss Ye, I can tell Master Chang Xuan is really taken with you.

62
09:28.633 --> 09:31.273
Maple Mansion used to be so quiet and empty.

63
09:31.273 --> 09:33.800
You're the first woman he's ever brought back here.

64
09:35.760 --> 09:38.892
- Isn't your cousin in the army? - Yes.

65
09:38.892 --> 09:44.194
You'd better warn him to be extra careful for the next couple of days.

66
09:44.194 --> 09:46.893
Why? Did you hear anything?

67
09:46.893 --> 09:48.614
It's about the mole, of course.

68
09:48.614 --> 09:50.954
They've got to tighten up military discipline.

69
09:50.954 --> 09:54.094
Tell your cousin to watch his step. Don't walk into the mess.

70
09:55.553 --> 10:00.553
Wait, wasn't that the translator who studied in Japan?

71
10:00.553 --> 10:01.994
What's happened to him?

72
10:01.994 --> 10:03.500
What do you think?

73
10:06.114 --> 10:09.354
They executed him at the execution site today. Shot on the spot.

74
10:09.354 --> 10:15.053
After all the trouble he caused the Yu Army, a bullet was too good for him.

75
10:15.053 --> 10:16.474
True enough.

76
10:18.954 --> 10:20.760
Xue Ting...

77
10:20.760 --> 10:22.573
Xue Ting!

78
10:30.400 --> 10:32.859
Dr. Wei, how is the patient?

79
10:32.859 --> 10:35.280
Master Chang Xuan, if I'd known you were him,

80
10:35.280 --> 10:37.857
- I wouldn't have-- - How is the patient?

81
10:37.857 --> 10:39.177
Rest assured.

82
10:39.177 --> 10:42.873
The surgery was a complete success. All she needs now is proper rest.

83
10:45.280 --> 10:46.760
Now you can relax.

84
10:46.760 --> 10:49.680
You've been driving all night, and you're hurt. Go home and get some rest.

85
10:49.680 --> 10:51.004
Bo Ren's right.

86
10:51.004 --> 10:54.194
We will stay at the hospital and keep an eye on Madam Ye.

87
10:54.194 --> 10:56.053
- I'll drive you back. - To Maple Mansion.

88
10:56.053 --> 10:57.240
I've been gone a whole day.

89
10:57.240 --> 10:59.086
I want to know how she's doing.

90
11:54.480 --> 11:55.881
Why are you still up so late?

91
12:05.553 --> 12:07.173
I'm waiting for you.

92
12:21.053 --> 12:22.354
Let me do it.

93
12:38.753 --> 12:39.773
Let me.

94
12:54.413 --> 12:56.314
What's made you so happy today?

95
13:00.400 --> 13:06.553
Every day that goes by puts Xue Ting one day closer to getting out.

96
13:06.553 --> 13:08.413
Of course I'm happy.

97
13:15.560 --> 13:17.813
I've told you over and over.

98
13:18.480 --> 13:20.439
Why won't you just learn to behave?

99
13:28.114 --> 13:30.653
Can't stand him that much?

100
13:31.880 --> 13:33.186
What do you think?

101
13:40.013 --> 13:41.834
So you killed him.

102
13:50.440 --> 13:51.814
What are you talking about?

103
13:51.814 --> 13:53.173
Yu Chang Xuan,

104
13:54.814 --> 13:57.614
you've been lying to me from the start.

105
14:00.434 --> 14:02.994
You killed Xue Ting. Today.

106
14:12.114 --> 14:13.300
Yes.

107
14:14.560 --> 14:16.013
I killed him.

108
14:17.653 --> 14:19.066
And now?

109
14:20.793 --> 14:22.120
Are you going to kill me?

110
14:22.120 --> 14:23.801
I'm going to kill you!

111
14:29.880 --> 14:32.779
So love really does make people this brave.

112
14:33.920 --> 14:38.423
I should've let you two see each other before Jiang Xue Ting died.

113
14:38.423 --> 14:43.724
Let you lovers have one last good cry in each other's arms.

114
14:47.440 --> 14:49.106
Yu Chang Xuan...

115
14:51.640 --> 14:54.460
Do you have any idea how much I hate you right now?

116
14:56.880 --> 14:59.954
- How much? - I want you to suffer forever.

117
14:59.954 --> 15:02.013
I wish you'd rot in hell!

118
15:03.120 --> 15:04.460
Funny.

119
15:05.600 --> 15:11.061
Jiang Xue Ting said the same thing before he died.

120
15:18.614 --> 15:20.114
Go on, shoot.

121
15:20.114 --> 15:21.699
Weren't you going to kill me?

122
15:22.494 --> 15:25.160
Aim better if you want me dead.

123
15:25.160 --> 15:27.153
Shoot!

124
15:27.153 --> 15:28.454
Shoot me!

125
15:30.114 --> 15:31.666
Shoot!

126
16:53.714 --> 16:55.873
I was this close.

127
16:57.520 --> 17:00.760
This close to killing you.

128
17:10.120 --> 17:11.279
Yes.

129
17:13.494 --> 17:15.013
What a pity.

130
17:18.414 --> 17:21.234
So you'll just have to stay right here by my side, be my good girl,

131
17:23.234 --> 17:24.874
and wait for your next chance.

132
17:30.793 --> 17:32.813
I'll be waiting for you to try again.

133
17:59.894 --> 18:01.553
Drinking alone?

134
18:03.200 --> 18:05.213
How about a dance tonight?

135
18:06.353 --> 18:10.053
Hey! My sister had it custom-made in Paris! What's wrong with you?

136
18:10.053 --> 18:12.013
Alright, let's go. Go.

137
18:14.600 --> 18:15.959
Look at this!

138
18:18.553 --> 18:20.313
What's with her? What's she so mad about?

139
18:20.313 --> 18:25.053
God knows. I asked her for a dance tonight, and look, she threw a drink all over me.

140
18:25.053 --> 18:27.276
Today she's a real tigress.

141
18:27.276 --> 18:30.934
Poke her or not, she'll bite your head off. Just stay away from her.

142
18:30.934 --> 18:32.393
- Let's go. - We're off.

143
18:35.894 --> 18:37.380
That makes sense.

144
19:07.353 --> 19:10.894
Didn't expect Miss Tao to be in such high spirits,

145
19:10.894 --> 19:13.593
drinking this much before dark.

146
19:14.720 --> 19:18.154
Since when is my business any of yours?

147
19:18.154 --> 19:21.793
Tell me who upset you.

148
19:24.360 --> 19:27.280
I'll settle it for you. How about that?

149
19:37.894 --> 19:39.253
Get lost.

150
19:55.894 --> 19:57.333
Let me tell you,

151
19:57.914 --> 20:02.414
whoever upset you, they're not worth your tears or your anger.

152
20:02.414 --> 20:04.954
You're the only one who matters.

153
20:04.954 --> 20:06.253
Understand?

154
20:27.374 --> 20:29.093
Li Bo Ren.

155
20:29.880 --> 20:34.653
When I'm sober, you're always fooling around.

156
20:35.394 --> 20:40.694
So why are you acting all proper now that I'm drunk?

157
20:50.593 --> 20:52.253
Let me take you home.

158
20:52.253 --> 20:53.894
Let go! I'm not going back.

159
20:53.894 --> 20:56.253
- Just work with me. - I'm not going back!

160
20:56.253 --> 20:57.954
- You've had enough. - I'm not going back!

161
21:21.934 --> 21:23.013
So?

162
21:23.800 --> 21:25.353
Are you feeling better now?

163
21:25.353 --> 21:26.674
Can we go?

164
21:33.000 --> 21:35.253
Why aren't you mad?

165
21:37.040 --> 21:38.293
I'm used to it.

166
21:39.020 --> 21:40.113
Come on.

167
21:40.720 --> 21:41.980
Let's go.

168
21:42.800 --> 21:44.166
Watch your step.

169
21:56.194 --> 21:59.093
We just wrapped up drills, and we're still buried in work at the arsenal.

170
21:59.093 --> 22:00.394
What on earth happened?

171
22:00.394 --> 22:02.374
Master Chang Xuan's been holed up at Maple Mansion for three days straight

172
22:02.374 --> 22:04.006
and won't even pick up the phone.

173
22:16.293 --> 22:18.313
What is going on?

174
22:23.013 --> 22:24.753
Advisor Li, what brings you two here?

175
22:24.753 --> 22:25.934
How's Master Chang Xuan doing?

176
22:25.934 --> 22:28.293
Miss Ye hasn't eaten or drunk anything for three days.

177
22:28.293 --> 22:31.174
Master Chang Xuan is sitting with her right now.

178
22:42.640 --> 22:44.480
Has she woken up?

179
22:44.480 --> 22:47.400
She was unconscious back then, still running a fever.

180
22:47.400 --> 22:49.050
Just now her fingers twitched.

181
22:49.050 --> 22:52.160
Looked like she might be waking up, but she won't open her eyes.

182
22:57.773 --> 23:00.174
Get some congee into her, and then give her the medicine.

183
23:00.174 --> 23:01.234
Yes, sir.

184
23:04.960 --> 23:07.800
Miss Ye, I've brought you some congee.

185
23:08.773 --> 23:10.073
Miss Ye.

186
23:19.573 --> 23:21.093
Get another bowl.

187
23:21.093 --> 23:22.214
Yes, sir.

188
23:31.280 --> 23:35.454
Ye Ping Jun, I've put up with you for three days.

189
23:35.454 --> 23:39.674
You really think I'd just let you have your way and die right in front of me?

190
23:45.414 --> 23:47.093
If you've got the guts to die,

191
23:47.760 --> 23:50.760
Jiang Xue Ting dies tonight.

192
24:07.080 --> 24:08.766
What did you say?

193
24:10.374 --> 24:12.253
Jiang Xue Ting isn't dead.

194
24:18.960 --> 24:20.380
You're lying.

195
24:30.440 --> 24:32.240
But if you die,

196
24:33.200 --> 24:36.600
I'll make sure Jiang Xue Ting follows you.

197
24:39.033 --> 24:40.293
You're lying.

198
24:43.680 --> 24:44.940
That's impossible.

199
24:45.654 --> 24:47.853
I heard it with my own ears.

200
24:49.960 --> 24:51.726
Believe it or not.

201
25:09.120 --> 25:10.540
Master Chang Xuan.

202
25:21.793 --> 25:23.066
Take the congee.

203
26:08.333 --> 26:09.813
Open your mouth.

204
26:33.253 --> 26:34.720
This is bad.

205
26:34.720 --> 26:36.320
Really bad.

206
26:38.154 --> 26:41.640
I thought Master Chang Xuan liked Ye Ping Jun because she was pretty and stubborn.

207
26:41.640 --> 26:43.944
All that bickering and fuss made things interesting.

208
26:43.944 --> 26:46.088
But now it looks like

209
26:46.088 --> 26:50.513
Master Chang Xuan values Ye Ping Jun more than his own life.

210
26:51.513 --> 26:54.286
I thought he was dallying with her.

211
26:55.313 --> 26:57.813
Turns out he's truly in love.

212
27:01.560 --> 27:04.313
Looks like he doesn't have time for us today.

213
27:04.313 --> 27:05.494
Let's go back.

214
27:07.813 --> 27:09.613
Don't you want to hear the rest?

215
27:09.613 --> 27:11.593
You're so indifferent.

216
27:26.013 --> 27:27.493
Ping Jun.

217
28:03.273 --> 28:05.053
In this life,

218
28:06.593 --> 28:08.293
you belong to me.

219
28:10.040 --> 28:12.046
No one's taking you away.

220
28:43.914 --> 28:44.993
Don't move.

221
28:55.760 --> 28:58.520
Commander, Shang Hong Wen was caught by Yu Chang Xuan.

222
28:58.520 --> 29:01.253
I wonder if he can keep his mouth shut.

223
29:01.253 --> 29:06.113
Then we'll see how much he cares about his wife and child.

224
29:08.234 --> 29:10.333
Yu Chang Xuan...

225
29:11.654 --> 29:15.313
I've found myself a worthy opponent.

226
29:20.573 --> 29:24.174
But we have plenty of time.

227
29:36.793 --> 29:37.794
Move.

228
29:41.800 --> 29:43.000
No dawdling.

229
29:48.753 --> 29:49.866
Move!

230
29:50.533 --> 29:51.541
Quickly!

231
30:02.200 --> 30:04.013
Move! Faster!

232
30:08.694 --> 30:09.707
Go!

233
30:14.720 --> 30:16.133
Faster!

234
30:23.680 --> 30:24.840
Get in!

235
31:02.674 --> 31:04.960
You handed over the evidence.

236
31:04.960 --> 31:07.560
You made the arrest.

237
31:07.560 --> 31:11.680
And now you're letting him go?

238
31:11.680 --> 31:14.549
Keep changing your mind like this...

239
31:14.549 --> 31:17.153
You owe me an explanation.

240
31:19.773 --> 31:24.400
A while back, you took a blade for that girl,

241
31:24.400 --> 31:27.483
and she's Jiang Xue Ting's fiancée.

242
31:27.483 --> 31:29.194
You did it right out in the open.

243
31:29.194 --> 31:31.293
You think people can't tell what's really going on?

244
31:31.892 --> 31:34.360
A man in charge of troops

245
31:34.360 --> 31:37.093
can't let personal feelings get in the way.

246
31:45.640 --> 31:48.720
I'll arrange for Jiang Xue Ting to visit your mother in the hospital

247
31:48.720 --> 31:50.589
so she won't worry.

248
31:51.154 --> 31:54.874
But after that, he's going to Jiangzhou for three months of hard labor.

249
31:57.560 --> 31:58.919
And after that?

250
32:00.360 --> 32:01.800
This is a necessary process.

251
32:01.800 --> 32:03.400
No one can avoid it.

252
32:04.360 --> 32:08.426
But once he walks out of the prison, he's safe.

253
32:09.240 --> 32:13.381
After three months, he will be completely free.

254
32:16.400 --> 32:18.566
But our terms need to change.

255
32:20.080 --> 32:22.087
One year isn't enough.

256
32:28.080 --> 32:29.921
Then how long do you want?

257
32:33.440 --> 32:34.840
A lifetime.

258
32:43.293 --> 32:44.773
A lifetime?

259
32:46.374 --> 32:48.454
Yu Chang Xuan,

260
32:48.454 --> 32:52.380
you want this shameful relationship of ours to last a lifetime?

261
32:53.353 --> 32:55.214
Don't you think that's ridiculous?

262
33:09.513 --> 33:11.520
You said we are worlds apart.

263
33:11.520 --> 33:16.906
Then I'll have to bring you completely into mine.

264
33:19.914 --> 33:21.853
And if I don't?

265
33:24.374 --> 33:27.154
You'll drag Jiang Xue Ting back

266
33:28.520 --> 33:30.793
and threaten me with his life again?

267
33:35.553 --> 33:37.454
That could work too.

268
34:19.613 --> 34:20.974
Ye Ping Jun,

269
34:23.200 --> 34:25.546
I've hit my limit of patience.

270
34:27.673 --> 34:29.120
Do you understand?

271
34:48.974 --> 34:54.053
For opera singers, mistakes onstage are a cardinal sin.

272
34:54.920 --> 34:57.613
This time, it even made the papers,

273
34:58.354 --> 35:02.133
and your career is over.

274
35:03.720 --> 35:06.080
You don't have to perform here forever,

275
35:06.760 --> 35:09.310
If there's somewhere you want to go in the future,

276
35:09.310 --> 35:11.480
I'll make the arrangements for you.

277
35:11.480 --> 35:13.120
I'm not going anywhere.

278
35:15.414 --> 35:17.573
I'll stay right here.

279
35:17.573 --> 35:19.754
Whenever you want to hear a tune,

280
35:20.840 --> 35:22.200
I'll be here.

281
36:13.120 --> 36:16.240
I've heard about what's been going on with you lately.

282
36:16.240 --> 36:18.280
Life is like a play.

283
36:18.280 --> 36:20.260
You can't expect everything to go your way.

284
36:21.640 --> 36:23.600
But the rough patch will pass.

285
36:24.680 --> 36:26.826
Thank you, Director Liang.

286
36:27.880 --> 36:33.880
But in this world, not everything passes.

287
36:35.040 --> 36:39.626
Lan Qing, have you noticed?

288
36:44.320 --> 36:46.079
You've changed a little lately.

289
36:47.394 --> 36:48.953
What do you mean?

290
36:50.013 --> 36:52.513
The day I was discussing the script with Ping Jun,

291
36:53.454 --> 36:56.934
you brought Master Chang Xuan by the troupe on purpose, didn't you?

292
37:02.000 --> 37:06.741
For the next scene, I want him to say this line at the school gate.

293
37:19.320 --> 37:21.353
I don't know what you're talking about.

294
37:23.640 --> 37:25.493
It's okay if you won't admit it.

295
37:26.960 --> 37:28.853
I want you to know that,

296
37:31.713 --> 37:35.920
to me, you've always been a kind person.

297
37:35.920 --> 37:41.260
People give in to their dark side sometimes, but that doesn't change who they are.

298
37:42.894 --> 37:46.960
I've heard bits and pieces about what happened

299
37:46.960 --> 37:48.680
between you and Master Ming Xuan before.

300
37:48.680 --> 37:51.840
That's all in the past. I don't want to bring it up again.

301
37:51.840 --> 37:53.197
All right. We won't.

302
37:53.197 --> 37:54.546
We won't talk about it.

303
37:55.640 --> 37:58.181
You know,

304
37:59.280 --> 38:02.080
everyone has their own obsessions,

305
38:02.080 --> 38:04.066
their own corners they're backed into.

306
38:04.066 --> 38:09.520
Greed, anger, delusion, vanity, scheming, struggling...

307
38:09.520 --> 38:11.560
But those are all passing thoughts.

308
38:12.494 --> 38:16.314
When you look back later, you'll find they're really nothing much.

309
38:17.040 --> 38:19.513
In turbulent times like these,

310
38:19.513 --> 38:21.354
with a background like mine,

311
38:22.774 --> 38:24.593
who can I rely on?

312
38:26.280 --> 38:29.360
If the mountain won't come to you, go to the mountain.

313
38:29.360 --> 38:33.600
Today, a woman can also support herself.

314
38:33.600 --> 38:36.800
If you're willing to read and write, I can teach you.

315
38:36.800 --> 38:41.200
Once you can read, you can do so many things you enjoy,

316
38:41.200 --> 38:43.440
and see a world without limits.

317
38:45.713 --> 38:48.553
I entered this trade at four.

318
38:48.553 --> 38:52.774
What else can I do besides performing opera?

319
38:52.774 --> 38:56.400
It's too late to read and write now.

320
38:56.400 --> 39:01.454
Over the years, I've seen so many women...

321
39:01.454 --> 39:03.787
women as fellow performers, as wives, as concubines.

322
39:03.787 --> 39:05.626
No matter how capable a woman is,

323
39:06.613 --> 39:10.713
in this world she's like duckweed.

324
39:11.960 --> 39:16.301
She can't survive without someone to rely on.

325
39:43.173 --> 39:44.354
Master Chang Xuan.

326
39:45.560 --> 39:46.781
Master Chang Xuan.

327
39:48.320 --> 39:52.280
Master Chang Xuan, Miss Ye isn't in her room.

328
39:52.280 --> 39:53.440
Where is she?

329
39:54.160 --> 39:56.920
She's in the garden out back.

330
39:56.920 --> 39:58.700
None of us can get close to her.

331
39:58.700 --> 40:03.814
She's been sitting there in the rain. Looks like she's trying to ruin her health.

332
40:04.470 --> 40:07.713
She's been out there all afternoon.

333
41:11.260 --> 41:12.720
Yu Chang Xuan.

334
41:17.000 --> 41:18.980
I agree to your terms.

335
41:20.448 --> 41:22.607
I must have owed you in a past life.
